text:
Dear @VietnamAirlines,

I travelled on VN980 from New Delhi (DEL) to Hanoi (HAN) on 03 July 2026, Seat 24F.

I accidentally left my Tommy Hilfiger sling bag onboard containing:
• 🇮🇳 Indian Passport
• Vietnam Visa
• Ray-Ban sunglasses
• USD 1,600 in cash

After reporting the matter, I was relieved that Vietnam Airlines located and returned my bag. I sincerely appreciate that.
However, while my passport, visa and sunglasses were intact, the USD 1,600 was missing.

I respectfully request @VietnamAirlines to conduct a thorough investigation into the handling of my belongings from the time the aircraft was cleaned until the bag was returned. I hope the airline will uphold the highest standards of passenger trust and accountability.
I have also given a written complaint to the Immigration officer in Hanoi.
I would appreciate the support of the Embassy of India in Vietnam in ensuring this matter receives appropriate attention.

Booking/Flight: VN980 | Seat: 24F | Date: 03 Jul 2026

